{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0858e55e2c4f5bc7b0b6df4c85a94f7ac3b00d6ad415bc82046732625c8c0498", "ja": "ライブMC　～ライブはみんなで作るもの～", "zh": "演唱会主持　～演唱会是大家一起打造的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "efd4cc460d9f39733b4c39a16d0f5b2bf839ef89bddfdf6b23939f9c84484e9d", "ja": "杏奈や美希が観客と息ピッタリなコールアン\nドレスポンスを披露し、感心するやよい。\n志保は改めて声援の大切さを実感していた。\nアイドル達は観客の気持ちに応えるため、\n更なる盛り上がりを約束する。", "zh": "杏奈和美希展现了与观众默契十足的呼应，\n弥生感到敬佩，志保则再次感受到\n声援的重要性。\n为了回应观众的心意，\n偶像们答应要将气氛炒得更热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "3de96d43ef67461ad998eafb9242f86ce5a47802dd794c63a5318508a7533642", "ja": "みんな～、盛り上がってる～！？　盛り上がってる\n人は、杏奈と一緒に声出してね！　せーのーっ！", "zh": "大家～你们有没有嗨啊～！？\n嗨的人跟杏奈一起喊喔！预备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "d52c1fdd42e39b4ce0515ea59a4284d791896470ec8cb7255dd87244bf78f848", "ja": "「「イェーイ！！」」", "zh": "「「耶～！！」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "0493c7256974ee0b098abe5aa9ede2f0586ccbe86856bd934e58cca1b48fc6e4", "ja": "わあ～！　なんにも言ってないのに、ピッタリ！\nみんな、すごいですー！", "zh": "哇～！明明没有先讲好却这么一致！\n大家好厉害──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "291da7dbdd5723202608cdb35bc56fc0dbfd4553bf8261d5f707078525794b8e", "ja": "それじゃあ～、ミキには合わせられる？\nみんな、いくのーっ！　せーのーっ！", "zh": "那～跟美希可以配合吗？\n大家～要上啰──！预备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "049143642f463cb045199f691d7e2e67e12d1dea4f78a504b7dce4e63071a348", "ja": "「「あはっ☆」」", "zh": "「「啊哈☆」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3640358db7212d93ca0416e547451cf652ec00d77e0497997e1aa78171c9247", "ja": "すごい……。", "zh": "好厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "995a0fae0a7fecb2e62ecae9f147cea02895525cbbf02d96161bfaae5e4e8046", "ja": "杏奈たちのこと、ちゃんと見てくれてるんだね！\nえへへ、ありがとーっ☆　みんな、大好きー！", "zh": "大家都有好好看着杏奈我们呢！\n嘿嘿，谢谢～☆杏奈最喜欢大家了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "a093b05c2caffd6cd2b6bfdeaaa4c930c0057864382075de48cda4ee76cfe41b", "ja": "さっきの歌も、ピッタリなタイミングで応援して\nもらえて、とっても歌いやすかったですー！", "zh": "刚才那首歌也是，大家声援的时机都抓得很准，\n让我们唱起来很轻松──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "38f47b880a7ad0adba460554f826ea67e3bf6d233019fed040cc7deb67bd58e0", "ja": "『ライブはみんなで作るもの』っていいますけど……\n改めて、こういうことなのかなって思いました。", "zh": "有句话说『演唱会是大家一起打造的』……\n我再次感受到，就是现在这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "fff94f47b638973152a63f2beba4a6ee145e2bf43065550551edf2f4dde54244", "ja": "ミキ、うれしい気持ちをいっぱいもらったから、\nいっぱいいっぱい、お返ししてあげるね！", "zh": "美希收到了好多高兴的心情，\n所以也要还给你们好多好多的高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "fba7eb55247d6b6a2e2d2086f60a2f9399f6dad1308bf0adcf1c1c961dba546e", "ja": "この後のステージも、ビビッと盛り上げちゃうよ！\n楽しみにしててねーっ！", "zh": "之后的表演，杏奈我们也会充满活力地炒热气氛！\n大家敬请期待喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "1a796d4d8160fb8e00b3f123d21eeff8c393857b49347ecfe9a96ff80013113c", "ja": "応援してもらうばかりじゃなくて。\n私たちも、皆さんを応援するつもりで！", "zh": "不单是让各位声援我们，\n我们也会声援各位的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_04_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "bd486a321355c5e0931140dd5b4373d807b6bb47fdb97e3628f126c9efe48342", "ja": "うっうー！　私、メラメラーってしてきました！\nみんなで最後まで、一緒に！　盛り上がりましょー！", "zh": "呜呜──！我感觉热血沸腾了！\n大家一起嗨到最后吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
